[2026-06-03 00:01:43] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-BDD测试用例.md","old_string":"---\n\n## 二、Hooks 系统 BDD","new_string":"---\n\n### 1.14 GET /api/proxies 列出代理注册列表\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: 列出代理注册列表\n  作为监控用户\n  我需要查看所有已注册的代理\n  以便了解哪些代理正在运行\n\n  Background:\n    Given 后端服务已启动\n    And 数据库已初始化\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 获取所有代理列表\n    Given 数据库中存在以下代理:\n      | proxy_id | project_slug | status |\n      | 28364    | project-x    | active |\n      | 15287    | project-y    | active |\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/proxies\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含\n      \"\"\"\n      {\n        \"proxies\": [\n          {\"proxy_id\": \"28364\", \"project_slug\": \"project-x\", \"status\": \"active\"},\n          {\"proxy_id\": \"15287\", \"project_slug\": \"project-y\", \"status\": \"active\"}\n        ],\n        \"total\": 2\n      }\n      \"\"\"\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 按状态过滤代理\n    Given 数据库中存在以下代理:\n      | proxy_id | project_slug | status  |\n      | 28364    | project-x    | active  |\n      | 15287    | project-y    | offline |\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/proxies?status=active\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含 1 个代理\n    And 代理 proxy_id 应为 \"28364\"\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 按项目过滤代理\n    Given 数据库中存在以下代理:\n      | proxy_id | project_slug | status |\n      | 28364    | project-x    | active |\n      | 15287    | project-y    | active |\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/proxies?project=project-x\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含 1 个代理\n    And 代理 proxy_id 应为 \"28364\"\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 无代理时返回空列表\n    Given 数据库中无任何代理\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/proxies\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含\n      \"\"\"\n      {\n        \"proxies\": [],\n        \"total\": 0\n      }\n      \"\"\"\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 使用非 GET 方法请求\n    When 发送 POST 请求到 /api/proxies\n    Then 响应状态码应为 405\n    And 响应体应包含 \"method_not_allowed\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### 1.15 GET /api/status 获取系统状态\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: 获取系统状态\n  作为监控用户\n  我需要查看系统聚合状态\n  以便快速了解运行情况\n\n  Background:\n    Given 后端服务已启动\n    And 数据库已初始化\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 获取系统状态包含所有统计字段\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/status\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体应包含字段 \"status\" 值为 \"healthy\"\n    And 响应体应包含字段 \"version\"\n    And 响应体应包含字段 \"uptime_seconds\"\n    And 响应体应包含字段 \"timestamp\"\n    And 响应体应包含 \"stats\" 对象\n    And stats 应包含 \"active_sessions\"\n    And stats 应包含 \"active_proxies\"\n    And stats 应包含 \"pending_issues\"\n    And stats 应包含 \"total_machines\"\n    And stats 应包含 \"total_projects\"\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 统计字段反映真实数据\n    Given 数据库中存在 3 个活跃会话\n    And 数据库中存在 2 个活跃代理\n    And 数据库中存在 5 个非终态 Issue\n    And 数据库中存在 4 台机器\n    And 数据库中存在 6 个项目\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/status\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体 stats.active_sessions 应为 3\n    And 响应体 stats.active_proxies 应为 2\n    And 响应体 stats.pending_issues 应为 5\n    And 响应体 stats.total_machines 应为 4\n    And 响应体 stats.total_projects 应为 6\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: uptime_seconds 反映服务运行时间\n    Given 后端服务已运行超过 60 秒\n    When 发送 GET 请求到 /api/status\n    Then 响应状态码应为 200\n    And 响应体 uptime_seconds 应大于等于 60\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 使用非 GET 方法请求\n    When 发送 POST 请求到 /api/status\n    Then 响应状态码应为 405\n    And 响应体应包含 \"method_not_allowed\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 二、Hooks 系统 BDD","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"call_2cf5b32e5b094cc0ab5447b4"}
