[2026-06-03 00:02:09] [INFO] [PostToolBatch] Input: {"session_id":"1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-BDD测试用例.md","old_string":"### 3.5 系统状态页面 /status\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: 系统状态页面\n  作为运维人员\n  我需要查看系统运行状态\n  以便及时发现和处理问题\n\n  Background:\n    Given 后端服务正常运行\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 显示后端健康状态\n    Given 后端 /health 返回 {\"status\": \"ok\"}\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🟢 运行中\"\n    And 应显示最后检查时间\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 显示活跃会话\n    Given 后端有 2 个活跃会话\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示活跃会话列表\n    And 列表应包含所有 active 状态的会话\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 后端不可用时显示错误\n    Given 后端服务不可达\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🔴 后端服务不可用\"\n    And 应显示错误详情\n    And 应提供重试按钮\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 健康检查返回异常\n    Given 后端 /health 返回 500 错误\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🔴 后端异常\"\n    And 应显示错误码 500\n```","new_string":"### 3.5 系统状态页面 /status\n\n```gherkin\nFeature: 系统状态页面\n  作为运维人员\n  我需要查看系统运行状态\n  以便及时发现和处理问题\n\n  Background:\n    Given 后端服务正常运行\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 显示系统聚合状态\n    Given 后端 GET /api/status 返回\n      \"\"\"\n      {\n        \"status\": \"healthy\",\n        \"version\": \"v1.0.0\",\n        \"uptime_seconds\": 9300,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"active_sessions\": 3,\n          \"active_proxies\": 2,\n          \"pending_issues\": 5,\n          \"total_machines\": 4,\n          \"total_projects\": 6\n        }\n      }\n      \"\"\"\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🟢 运行中\"\n    And 页面应显示版本号 \"v1.0.0\"\n    And 页面应显示运行时间\n    And 页面应显示统计摘要（活跃会话 3、活跃代理 2、待处理 Issue 5）\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 显示代理注册列表\n    Given 后端 GET /api/proxies 返回 2 个活跃代理\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示代理列表表格\n    And 表格应显示代理 ID、项目、状态、注册时间、最后心跳\n\n  @positive\n  Scenario: 显示活跃会话\n    Given 后端有 2 个活跃会话\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示活跃会话列表\n    And 列表应包含所有 active 状态的会话\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 后端不可用时显示错误\n    Given 后端服务不可达\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🔴 后端服务不可用\"\n    And 应显示错误详情\n    And 应提供重试按钮\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: 健康检查返回异常\n    Given 后端 /health 返回 500 错误\n    When 用户访问 /status\n    Then 页面应显示 \"🔴 后端异常\"\n    And 应显示错误码 500\n```"},"tool_use_id":"call_292d37963bd944f1b6798fe2","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-BDD测试用例.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
