[2026-06-03 00:03:46] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\1b51e036-fd80-4ff2-ab54-87dea13ff9e7.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-hooks设计文档.md","old_string":"### 7.1 会话生命周期\n\n```\n[01-session-start]\n    │\n    ├──► POST /api/proxy/trace-init  →  初始化 trace 路径\n    │\n    └──► POST /api/session/register  →  注册会话到后端\n              │\n              ▼\n        [会话进行中... Issue 领取/状态更新]\n              │\n              ▼\n[29-session-end]\n    │\n    ├──► POST /api/issue/release-session  →  释放该会话所有 Issue\n    │\n    └──► POST /api/session/close  →  注销会话\n```","new_string":"### 7.1 会话生命周期\n\n```\n[01-session-start]\n    │\n    ├──► POST /api/proxy/trace-init  →  初始化 trace 路径\n    │\n    └──► POST /api/session/register  →  注册会话到后端\n              │\n              ▼\n        [会话进行中... Issue 领取/状态更新]\n              │\n              ▼\n        [可随时查询]\n              │\n              ├──► GET /api/status   →  查询系统聚合状态（供前端/状态栏使用）\n              │\n              └──► GET /api/proxies  →  查询代理注册列表\n              │\n              ▼\n[29-session-end]\n    │\n    ├──► POST /api/issue/release-session  →  释放该会话所有 Issue\n    │\n    └──► POST /api/session/close  →  注销会话\n```","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"call_974ee8e5b3354bb0bb01bda0"}
