service.go**\n- Cleans up timed-out sessions (older than 24 hours)\n\n**2. config_service.go**\n- System configuration business logic\n\n**3. idle_watchdog.go**\n- Monitors proxy.json for idle periods\n- Triggers graceful shutdown after 10 minutes of inactivity\n\n**4. issue_service.go**\n- Issue management business logic\n- Handles claiming, releasing, status updates, and listing\n\n**5. log_service.go**\n- Log parsing and querying functionality\n- Supports filtering by level and date\n\n**6. machine_service.go**\n- Machine listing and retrieval\n\n**7. project_service.go**\n- Project listing and retrieval\n\n**8. proxy_service.go**\n- Proxy listing with filtering\n\n**9. session_service.go**\n- Session registration, closing, listing, and retrieval\n\n**10. status_service.go**\n- System statistics aggregation\n- Counts active sessions, proxies, pending issues, etc.\n\n**11. token_service.go**\n- Token usage statistics by parsing trace files\n- Calculates totals for API calls, input/output tokens, cache usage\n\n**12. trace_service.go**\n- Trace file metadata extraction\n- Calculates file size and line counts\n\n### Store Layer (`D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\internal\\backend\\store\\`)\n\n**1. config_store.go**\n- SQLite implementation for system configuration\n- Supports key-value storage with validation\n\n**2. issue_store.go**\n- Issue persistence with optimistic locking\n- Auto-creates idle records for new issues\n- Supports claims, status updates, and releases\n\n**3. machine_store.go**\n- Machine data persistence\n\n**4. migrations.go**\n- Database schema creation\n- Tables for: machines, projects, sessions, issue_claims, config, proxies\n\n**5. project_store.go**\n- Project data persistence\n\n**6. proxy_store.go**\n- Proxy registration data persistence\n\n**7. session_store.go**\n- Session registration with transactional updates to machines and projects\n- Handles session closure and cleanup\n\n**8. sqlite.go**\n- SQLite store initialization and connection management\n- Enables WAL mode for better concurrency\n\n**9. store.go**\n- Domain interfaces and types\n- Common error definitions\n\n### Domain Layer (`D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\internal\\backend\\domain\\`)\n\n**1. issue.go**\n- Issue status enumeration (idle, claimed, fixing, ready-for-pr, etc.)\n- IssueClaim entity definition\n\n**2. machine.go**\n- Machine entity definition\n\n**3. project.go**\n- Project entity definition\n\n**4. session.go**\n- Session status enumeration (active, closed)\n- Session entity definition\n\n**5. token.go**\n- Token statistics structure with calculation methods\n\n### Server Integration (`D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\internal\\backend\\server.go`)\n\n- Main server initialization and startup\n- Service layer instantiation\n- Route registration via api.NewRouter\n- Graceful shutdown with signal handling\n- Idle watchdog integration\n\n## Key Features\n\n1. **Issue Management**: Full CRUD operations with optimistic locking and state machine\n2. **Session Management**: Tracks Claude Code sessions with metadata\n3. **Proxy Support**: Dynamic proxy registration and trace-init forwarding\n4. **Monitoring**: Health checks, system statistics, and log querying\n5. **Configuration Runtime**: Dynamic system configuration updates\n6. **Auto-cleanup**: Automatic session timeout cleanup and idle shutdown\n7. **Pagination**: Supports paginated listing for issues and sessions\n8. **Filtering**: Rich filtering options across all entities\n9. **Transaction Safety**: Database operations use transactions where appropriate\n\nThe backend follows a clean architecture with clear separation between API (HTTP), Service (business logic), and Store (persistence) layers, making it maintainable and testable."}]},{"tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-可视化页面线框图设计-v2.md"},"tool_use_id":"call_be7d03a570004aec91ede0ba","tool_response":"1\t# claude-tap-plus 可视化页面线框图设计（基于已有 API）\n2\t\n3\t> 文档日期：2026-06-01\n4\t> 严格基于后端已有 API 和数据库表结构设计，不假设任何未实现的接口。\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## 一、已有 API 清单（严格限定）\n9\t\n10\t| 端点 | 方法 | 功能 | 请求/响应 |\n11\t|------|------|------|-----------|\n12\t| `/health` | GET | 健康检查 | `{\"status\":\"ok\"}` |\n13\t| `/api/issue/check` | POST | 检查 Issue 状态 | `CheckIssuesRequest` / `CheckIssuesResponse` |\n14\t| `/api/issue/claim` | POST | 领取 Issue | `ClaimIssueRequest` / `ClaimIssueResponse` |\n15\t| `/api/issue/release` | POST | 释放 Issue | `ReleaseIssueRequest` / `ReleaseIssueResponse` |\n16\t| `/api/issue/release-session` | POST | 释放会话下所有 Issue | `ReleaseSessionRequest` / `ReleaseSessionResponse` |\n17\t| `/api/issue/status` | POST | 更新 Issue 状态 | `UpdateStatusRequest` / `UpdateStatusResponse` |\n18\t| `/api/session/register` | POST | 注册会话 | `RegisterSessionRequest` / `{\"status\":\"registered\"}` |\n19\t| `/api/session/close` | POST | 关闭会话 | `CloseSessionRequest` / `{\"status\":\"closed\"}` |\n20\t| `/api/sessions` | GET | 获取会话列表（支持过滤） | Query: `machine_id`, `project_slug`, `status` / `SessionListResponse` |\n21\t| `/api/session/{id}` | GET | 获取单个会话详情 | Path: session_id / `SessionDetail` |\n22\t| `/api/proxy/register` | POST | 代理注册 | `{\"pid\":\"\",\"proxy_url\":\"\"}` |\n23\t| `/api/proxy/unregister` | POST | 代理注销 | `{\"pid\":\"\"}` |\n24\t| `/api/proxy/trace-init` | POST | 转发 trace-init | 请求体原样转发 |\n25\t| `/api/proxies` | GET | 列出代理注册列表 | Query: `status`, `project` / `ProxiesResponse` |\n26\t| `/api/status` | GET | 系统聚合状态 | `StatusResponse`（含 `SystemStats`） |\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t## 二、已有数据模型\n31\t\n32\t### 2.1 IssueClaim（issue_claims 表）\n33\t\n34\t```go\n35\ttype IssueClaim struct {\n36\t    ID           int64       // 自增主键\n37\t    RepoFullName string      // 仓库全名\n38\t    IssueNumber  int         // GitHub issue 编号\n39\t    IssueTitle   string      // issue 标题（缓存）\n40\t    Status       IssueStatus // idle/claimed/fixing/ready-for-pr/pr-created/testing/reviewing/merged/rejected\n41\t    SessionID    string      // 领取者 session_id，idle 时为空\n42\t    ClaimedAt    *time.Time  // 领取时间\n43\t    UpdatedAt    time.Time   // 最后更新时间\n44\t}\n45\t```\n46\t\n47\t### 2.2 Session（sessions 表）\n48\t\n49\t```go\n50\ttype Session struct {\n51\t    ID             int64      // 自增主键\n52\t    SessionID      string     // UUID\n53\t    MachineID      string     // whoami@hostname\n54\t    OS             string     // windows/linux/macos\n55\t    ProjectSlug    string     // 项目标识\n56\t    ProjectCwd     string     // 工作目录\n57\t    TranscriptPath string     // 对话记录路径\n58\t    LocalTracePath string     // 本地 trace 文件路径\n59\t    Model          string     // 使用的模型\n60\t    Source         string     // startup/resume\n61\t    Status         string     // active/closed\n62\t    RegisteredAt   time.Time  // 注册时间\n63\t    ClosedAt       *time.Time // 关闭时间\n64\t    CloseReason    string     // 关闭原因\n65\t}\n66\t```\n67\t\n68\t### 2.3 Machine（machines 表）\n69\t\n70\t```go\n71\ttype Machine struct {\n72\t    ID          int64     // 自增主键\n73\t    MachineID   string    // whoami@hostname，UNIQUE\n74\t    OS          string    // windows/linux/macos\n75\t    Hostname    string    // 主机名\n76\t    Username    string    // 用户名\n77\t    FirstSeenAt time.Time // 首次注册时间\n78\t    LastSeenAt  time.Time // 最后活跃时间\n79\t}\n80\t```\n81\t\n82\t### 2.4 Project（projects 表）\n83\t\n84\t```go\n85\ttype Project struct {\n86\t    ID          int64     // 自增主键\n87\t    ProjectSlug string    // 项目标识，UNIQUE\n88\t    ProjectCwd  string    // 工作目录\n89\t    FirstSeenAt time.Time // 首次出现时间\n90\t    LastSeenAt  time.Time // 最后活跃时间\n91\t}\n92\t```\n93\t\n94\t### 2.5 Proxy（proxies 表）\n95\t\n96\t```go\n97\ttype Proxy struct {\n98\t    ProxyID      string     // 代理唯一标识（PID），PRIMARY KEY\n99\t    ProjectSlug  string     // 关联项目\n100\t    Status       string     // 代理状态：active / offline\n101\t    RegisteredAt time.Time  // 注册时间\n102\t    LastPingAt   *time.Time // 最后心跳时间（可为空）\n103\t}\n104\t```\n105\t\n106\t---\n107\t\n108\t## 三、页面设计（严格基于已有 API）\n109\t\n110\t### 3.1 仪表盘页面 (`/dashboard`)\n111\t\n112\t**可用数据来源**：\n113\t- `GET /health` — 服务状态\n114\t- `GET /api/status` — 聚合统计指标（活跃会话、活跃代理、待处理 Issue、机器总数、项目总数）\n115\t- `GET /api/sessions?status=active` — 活跃会话数\n116\t- `GET /api/sessions` — 总会话数（需前端计数）\n117\t\n118\t**不可用的数据（页面中不展示）**：\n119\t- ❌ Issue 总数统计（无 `GET /api/issues` 接口）\n120\t- ❌ Token 使用统计（无相关接口）\n121\t\n122\t```\n123\t┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n124\t│  🧠 Claude Tap Plus                                    [🔔] [⚙️] [👤]      │\n125\t├──────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n126\t│      │  📊 Dashboard                                                        │\n127\t│  📊  │                                                                      │\n128\t│  ──  │  ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n129\t│  🖥️  │  │ 🟢 活跃   │ │ ⏳ 待处理 │ │ 🟢 活跃   │ │ 🖥️ 机器   │ │ 📁 项目   │ │\n130\t│  📋  │  │ Sessions │ │ Issue   │ │ 代理     │ │  总数    │ │  总数    │ │\n131\t│      │  │          │ │          │ │          │ │          │ │          │ │\n132\t│      │  │   12     │ │    8     │ │    3     │ │    5     │ │    7     │ │\n133\t│      │  │ (实时)   │ │ (实时)   │ │ (实时)   │ │ (实时)   │ │ (实时)   │ │\n134\t│      │  └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n135\t│      │         ↑ 数据来源：GET /api/status → stats 字段                     │\n136\t│      │                                                                      │\n137\t│      │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n138\t│      │  │  🔔 最近会话活动（来自 GET /api/sessions）                        │ │\n139\t│      │  │  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │ │\n140\t│      │  │  [🟢] 14:32  abc123...  project-x   user@host-1   active       │ │\n141\t│      │  │  [🟢] 14:28  def456...  project-y   user@host-2   active       │ │\n142\t│      │  │  [🔴] 14:15  xyz789...  project-x   user@host-1   closed       │ │\n143\t│      │  │  [🟢] 14:10  ghi012...  project-z   user@host-3   active       │ │\n144\t│      │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n145\t│      │                                                                      │\n146\t│      │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n147\t│      │  │  ⚠️  限制说明                                                   │ │\n148\t│      │  │  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │ │\n149\t│      │  │  以下数据需要后端扩展 API 才能展示：                              │ │\n150\t│      │  │  • Issue 状态分布（需要 GET /api/issues）                        │ │\n151\t│      │  │  • Token 统计（需要 GET /api/session/{id}/tokens）               │ │\n152\t│      │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n153\t│      │                                                                      │\n154\t└──────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n155\t```\n156\t\n157\t---\n158\t\n159\t### 3.2 会话列表页面 (`/sessions`)\n160\t\n161\t**可用 API**：\n162\t- `GET /api/sessions?machine_id=xxx&project_slug=xxx&status=xxx` — 列表 + 过滤\n163\t- `GET /api/session/{id}` — 详情\n164\t- `POST /api/session/close` — 手动关闭\n165\t\n166\t```\n167\t┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n168\t│  🧠 Claude Tap Plus                                    [🔔] [⚙️] [👤]      │\n169\t├──────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n170\t│      │  🖥️ 会话列表                                                         │\n171\t│  📊  │                                                                      │\n172\t│  🖥️  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n173\t│  ──  │  │  🔍 搜索 Session ID...                                          │ │\n174\t│  📋  │  │  [状态 ▼] [项目 ▼] [机器