\"session_id\": null },             │\n│     ...                                 │\n│   ],                                    │\n│   \"total\": 42,                          │\n│   \"page\": 1,                            │\n│   \"page_size\": 20,                      │\n│   \"total_pages\": 3                      │\n│ }                                       │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n渲染 Issue 列表 + 分页\n    │\n    ▼\n用户操作（领取/释放/更新状态）\n    │\n    ▼\nPOST /api/issue/claim 或 /release 或 /status\n    │\n    ▼\n操作成功后重新查询刷新\n```"},"tool_use_id":"call_14ef5e7ce922493491223af9","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-可视化页面线框图设计-v2.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
