es    →  查询会话关联 Issue\n              ├──► GET /api/logs     →  查询后端日志\n              ├──► GET /api/config   →  查询系统配置\n              └──► PUT /api/config   →  更新系统配置\n              │\n              ▼\n[29-session-end]\n    │\n    ├──► POST /api/issue/release-session  →  释放该会话所有 Issue\n    │\n    └──► POST /api/session/close  →  注销会话\n```"},"tool_use_id":"call_060984b5ed334243aedf22b4","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-06-01\\2026-06-01-hooks设计文档.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
